sin⁡x.$\n\n- Then, reflect it in the $x$-axis to give $y=-sin⁡x.$\n\nTherefore, the given curve is the graph of $y=-sin⁡x.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186111359 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110570 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "76b0ad1e-827e-5795-8431-3276c8eed881" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Values in the Range of the Inverse Sine Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01d13210-364c-5acb-9f54-0dd1737a9144" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5\\pi }{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333005} {:answer/id #uuid "0e10a39b-7068-573a-beaf-f80b0523a885" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333113} {:answer/id #uuid "38eaff14-ee64-5856-acc0-b6d12f67e732" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2\\pi }{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333518} {:answer/id #uuid "3c0e0a46-f05d-5d74-a3e8-97060fca7098" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333554} {:answer/id #uuid "e3748433-8880-5c29-a67c-7779fa45fb2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334971}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e3748433-8880-5c29-a67c-7779fa45fb2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334971} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b967f0c-8050-5893-8f47-393e238d1a15" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335321}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "dd07e30f-3efc-5402-ba48-42c8b2dc33b3" :question/math-academy-id "q-65807" :question/problem "Which of the following values is in the range of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/df/df22eea4331c47da3047381ca672fd80ebf75118054316fe88c0e2d96dae0d34.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The range of the function is $y\\in [-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{\\pi }{2}].$\n\nTherefore, of the given values, only $y=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ is in the range of the function."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335854 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110570 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "76b0ad1e-827e-5795-8431-3276c8eed881" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Values in the Range of the Inverse Sine Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11906e5d-09be-5515-907a-455c16791a7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333146} {:answer/id #uuid "15e82f87-144a-5fc1-936d-89bb83c45977" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333187} {:answer/id #uuid "91074ce3-4d34-5e65-ae9b-1202592f1a82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334281} {:answer/id #uuid "965a3749-5b40-5bca-95cf-fac6962c4d2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334328} {:answer/id #uuid "ed7533f9-c776-5517-8ed6-78df8fea9a8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4\\pi }{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335072}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91074ce3-4d34-5e65-ae9b-1202592f1a82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334281} :answer-field/id #uuid "903d63c1-b910-547e-90b1-17b090c4e3